  "$PROBLEM    2-class CL mixture,1-cpt IV: MATRIX=S at the FOCEI",
  ";           finals,MAXEVAL=0 (#1956)",
  "; mixture_iv_cov.ctl with the THETA initials set to its .ext finals (as printed, 6 sig. fig.)",
